    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 8,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-08-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "钟山之神，名曰烛阴，视为昼，瞑为夜；吹为冬，呼为"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-19",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "烛阴西北海之外，赤水之北，有章尾山"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-19",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "不息，风雨是谒。是烛九阴，是谓烛龙。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "chuci-03-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n何气通焉？\n\n日安不到,\n\n烛龙何照？\n\n羲和之未扬,\n\n若华"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "。孟诸在沛。少室、太室在冀州。烛龙在雁门北，蔽于委羽之山，不见日"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
